; Rescued, not a starter: the Court's chapter wizard, freed by seeking his voice from room to room of the
; dark wizard's house until he is found at his desk (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.10). Michel de Nostredame,
; physician and seer, astrologer to a court - kept to read what is coming, and what is coming is the
; player. His passive is Foresight, the one axis no other wizard owns: every enemy wind-up shows 15%
; longer, so a tell gives more time to step out of it. He opens on Starfall (Light), which no one else
; opens on; Light is shared with Seimei and Merlin on different spells (R1).
